<title>MEXICO: MEXICO COFFEE EXPORT UPDATE TO JULY - COUNCIL.</title>
<headline>MEXICO COFFEE EXPORT UPDATE TO JULY - COUNCIL.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican coffee exports were 130,080 60-kg bags in July compared to the 219,432 bags in Jult last year, the Mexican Coffee Council said in a report obtained Wednesday.</p>
<p>Exports to July in the October-September cycle totaled 4,255,473 bags, the council added. A full breakdown of the Mexican exports follows in table form. Figures are for 60-kg bags.  </p>
<p>    Month     1996-1997	 1995-1996	    1994-1995</p>
<p>    October    163,489	   101,912		 59,303</p>
<p>    November   320,842	   296,510		131,767</p>
<p>    December   390,111	   421,445		260,081</p>
<p>    January    871,321	   745,428		586,669</p>
<p>    February   837,812	   742,815		460,060</p>
<p>    March	671,570	   631,513		603,537</p>
<p>    April	447,980	   529,015		243,772</p>
<p>    May	  274,239	   458,195		287,238</p>
<p>    June	 148,029	   193,293		217,951</p>
<p>    July	 130,080	   219,432		121,033</p>
<p>    August	 --		146,745		184,466</p>
<p>    September    --		 92,554		101,867</p>
<p>    Total   *4,255,473	 4,576,327	    3,257,744</p>
<p>* Total to date in the cycle.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
